        "id": 237300,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-06T12:40:42.749Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really hate OA one-shots. Nothing like spending two hours playing a game only to lose it horribly because there was nothing you could do better. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/expressionless.png?v=9\" title=\":expressionless:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":expressionless:\"> He starts off by killing Dr. Medico and really just did nothing but insta-incap heroes and summon scions for the rest of the game. This was the easiest I’ve ever gotten rid of Effusion of Pain, and it’s nice only taking 3 extra damage in phase 1, but when you’ve only got three heroes, there’s just nothing you can do about there being more than three scions in play. You’re gonna lose no matter what.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-05-06T12:40:42.749Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
