        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-05-10T23:23:55.189Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I decided to go back in one more time, and I actually beat it?</p>\n<p>The secret apparently was bringing in SaDmark as… I think my first hero replacement. Maybe my second, I don’t remember. But I got him Apex of Humanity, after which he was completely unstoppable. That was basically it, along with Stuntman going out in a blaze of glory and trapping Borr in Insula Primalis where the volcano took him out and no one else was around to see it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 8,
